  },
  {
   "__type__": "StringTableEntry",
   "__typeHash__": 3844612145,
   "szLabel": "Line70.BAE4.Bar",
   "szText": "And until I mentioned Skovos, you didn’t care at all. Something about these Pools has you scared. I need to know what.",
   "hLabel": 2096873148
